  "title": "Individual Spinach-Ricotta Puff Pastry Quiches",
  "description": "Cheese lovers will delight in these mini spinach puff pastry quiches made with spinach and four cheeses--ricotta, mozzarella, Parmesan, and fontina.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
